================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
================================================================================

The MIT licence above covers the code written by this paper's authors:
RMMC.m, rmmc_defaults.m, MMC_half.m, utils/, baselines/RMC_HOW/ and
experiments/.

The package also redistributes the following components.  Each keeps its own
licence, reproduced or referenced next to the component.

1. RTCUR -- Robust Tensor CUR Decompositions
   baselines/RTCUR/  (LICENSE included)
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 Longxiu Huang.
   Source: https://github.com/huangl3/RTCUR
   Reference: H. Cai, Z. Chao, L. Huang, D. Needell, "Robust Tensor CUR
   Decompositions: Rapid Low-Tucker-Rank Tensor Recovery with Sparse
   Corruptions", SIAM J. Imaging Sci., 17(1):225-247, 2024.

2. RGNMR -- Gauss-Newton method for robust matrix completion
   baselines/RGNMR/  (LICENSE included)
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Eilon Vaknin Laufer.
   Source: https://github.com/eilon96/RGNMR
   Reference: E. Vaknin Laufer, B. Nadler, "RGNMR: A Gauss-Newton method for
   robust matrix completion with theoretical guarantees", NeurIPS 2025.

3. Tensor Toolbox for MATLAB v3.1
   third_party/tensor_toolbox/  (LICENSE.txt included)
   Copyright (2018) Sandia Corporation; BSD-style licence permitting
   redistribution with the notice.  Required by the RTCUR and TriTD baselines.

4. TriTD -- Fast and Robust Triple Tensor Decomposition
   baselines/TriTD/  (see PROVENANCE.txt)
   Source: https://github.com/thanhle88/Triple-Tensor-Decomposition-with-ADMM
   Reference: N. Q. Dang, D. M. Nhat, T. T. Le, N. L. Trung, K. Abed-Meraim,
   "Fast and Robust Triple Tensor Decomposition with Data Corruption",
   ICASSP 2026, pp. 301-305.
   Redistributed verbatim for reproducibility of the comparison in the paper;
   no separate licence file was shipped with the release.

5. MMC -- Multi-Matrix Completion
   MMC.m is the authors' copy of the reference implementation released with
   H. N. Sheng, Z.-Y. Wang, H. C. So, A. M. Zoubir, "Multi-Matrix Completion:
   A Novel Framework for Structurally Missing Elements", IEEE TPAMI,
   48(2):1626-1640, 2026.

6. ORL face database
   data/orl/  -- The ORL Database of Faces, AT&T Laboratories Cambridge.
   https://cam-orl.co.uk/facedatabase.html
   Redistributed for research use with attribution.
